{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-11738", "kind": "poc", "title": "WordPress Duplicator duplicator.php 任意文件读取漏洞 CVE-2020-11738", "technique": "path-traversal", "summary": "CMS漏洞 / CVE-2020-11738。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-11738 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["CMS漏洞", "CVE-2020-11738"], "payload_template": "public static function duplicator_download() {\n        $file = sanitize_text_field($_GET['file']);\n        $filepath = DUPLICATOR_SSDIR_PATH.'/'.$file;\n        // Process download\n        if(file_exists($filepath)) {\n            // Clean output buffer\n            if (ob_get_level() !== 0 && @ob_end_clean() === FALSE) {\n                @ob_clean();\n            }\n\n            header('Content-Description: File Transfer');\n            header('Content-Type: application/octet-stream');\n            header('Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"'.basename($filepath).'\"');\n            header('Expires: 0');\n            header('Cache-Control: must-revalidate');\n            header('Pragma: public');\n            header('Content-Length: ' . filesize($filepath));\n            flush(); // Flush system output buffer\n\n            try {\n                $fp = @fopen($filepath, 'r');\n                if (false === $fp) {\n                    throw new Exception('Fail to open the file '.$filepath);\n                }\n                while (!feof($fp) && ($data = fread($fp, DUPLICATOR_BUFFER_READ_WRITE_SIZE)) !== FALSE) {\n                    echo $data;\n                }\n                @fclose($fp);\n            } catch (Exception $e) {\n                readfile($filepath);\n            }\n            exit;\n        } else {\n            wp_die('Invalid installer file name!!');\n        }\n    }", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps