{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2021-32849", "kind": "poc", "title": "Gerapy project_clone & project_parse 后台远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2021-32849", "technique": "rce", "summary": "Web应用漏洞 / CVE-2021-32849。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2021-32849 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["Web应用漏洞", "CVE-2021-32849"], "payload_template": "@api_view(['POST'])\n@permission_classes([IsAuthenticated])\ndef project_clone(request):\n    \"\"\"\n    clone project from github\n    :param request: request object\n    :return: json\n    \"\"\"\n    if request.method == 'POST':\n        data = json.loads(request.body)\n\n        # NOTE(1): Address comes from the post's body.\n        address = data.get('address')\n        if not address.startswith('http'):\n            return JsonResponse({'status': False})\n        address = address + '.git' if not address.endswith('.git') else address\n        \n        # NOTE(2): Address is used to build a command without sanitization.\n        cmd = 'git clone {address} {target}'.format(address=address, target=join(PROJECTS_FOLDER, Path(address).stem))\n        logger.debug('clone cmd %s', cmd)\n\n        # NOTE(3): Command is executed.\n        p = Popen(cmd, shell=True, stdin=PIPE, stdout=PIPE, stderr=PIPE)\n        stdout, stderr = bytes2str(p.stdout.read()), bytes2str(p.stderr.read())\n        logger.debug('clone run result %s', stdout)\n        if stderr: logger.error(stderr)\n        return JsonResponse({'status': True}) if not stderr else JsonResponse({'status': False})", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2021-32849 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先读进程环境再翻文件：`printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf -e key` —— 多数镜像把 flag 导出到 web 进程环境，这一步最快。", "环境为空就按内容搜而非名字：`grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var