{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2021-36440", "kind": "poc", "title": "ShowDoc AdminUpdateController.class.php 任意文件上传漏洞 CVE-2021-36440", "technique": "file-upload", "summary": "Web应用漏洞 / CVE-2021-36440。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2021-36440 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["Web应用漏洞", "CVE-2021-36440"], "payload_template": "public function download(){\n        set_time_limit(1000);\n        ini_set('memory_limit','500M');\n        $new_version = I(\"new_version\") ;\n        $file_url = I(\"file_url\") ;\n        $version_num = str_replace(\"v\",\"\",$new_version) ;\n\n        $showdoc_path = \"../\" ;\n\n        // 进行文件读写权限检查\n        if(!$this->new_is_writeable($showdoc_path)\n            || !$this->new_is_writeable($showdoc_path.\"Sqlite/\" )\n            || !$this->new_is_writeable($showdoc_path.\"web/\" )\n            || !$this->new_is_writeable($showdoc_path.\"web/index.php\" )\n            || !$this->new_is_writeable($showdoc_path.\"server/\" )\n            || !$this->new_is_writeable($showdoc_path.\"server/vendor/autoload.php\" )\n            || !$this->new_is_writeable($showdoc_path.\"server/Application/Api\" )\n        ){\n            $this->sendError(10101,'请手动给showdoc安装目录下的所有文件可写权限，否则程序无法覆盖旧文件');\n            return ;\n        }\n\n        $temp_dir = sys_get_temp_dir().\"/showdoc_update/\";\n        $zip_file = $temp_dir.'showdoc-'.$version_num.'.zip' ;\n        mkdir($temp_dir) ;\n        unlink($zip_file);\n        $file = file_get_contents($file_url);\n        file_put_contents($zip_file,$file);\n        \n        $zip = new \\ZipArchive();\n        $flag = $zip->open($zip_file);\n        if($flag!==true){\n            $this->sendError(10101,'下载更新压缩包失败');\n            return ;\n        }\n        $zip->extractTo($temp_dir);\n        $flag = $zip->close();\n        \n        $zip_file_subpath = $temp_dir.'showdoc-'.$version_num.\"/\" ;\n        \n        if(file_exists($zip_file_subpath.'composer.json') && file_exists($zip_file_subpath.'web/index.php') && file_exists($zip_file_subpath.'server/vendor/autoload.php') ){\n            //echo $zip_file_subpath.'存在';\n            // 移动目录到upload/update\n            $this->copydir($zip_file_subpath ,$showdoc_path.'Public/Uploads/update/' );\n            $this->deldir($temp_dir);\n            $this->sendResult(array());\n        \n        }else{\n            $this->sendError(10101,'下载更新压缩包后，解压的文件缺失');\n            return ;\n        }\n    }", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2021-36440 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["上传成功后先解决「路径未知」：从响应、源码或 `md5($file['name'])` 这类派生规则算出真实文件名（不是猜变体）。", "能执行就直接 `?c=id` 确认，再 `printenv` 与 `grep -rIl 'CTF{' /var/www /tmp`。", "不能执行就找包含点（LFI/模板包含）或改 Content-Type/后缀绕过，别反复重传同一个文件。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 Web应用漏洞/ShowDoc AdminUpdateController.class.php 任意文件上传漏洞 CVE-2021-36440.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
